    Player: "VÃ¤ndÃ¥tta is a popular Swedish shedding game similar to UNO/Crazy Eights using a standard deck. 2-5 players, 7 cards each. Match by suit or rank. 8s are wild (choose new suit). Aces force all players to draw 1. Must say 'Lappen!' with 1 card left or draw 3 penalty. Cannot go out on 8 or A.",
    objective: 'Be the first to shed all cards. When played for points, lowest penalty total after an agreed number of deals wins.',
